WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.453 --> 00:00:19.533
Praise and thanks to Allah SWT, who has bestowed abundant grace and blessings upon us all

2
00:00:19.947 --> 00:00:23.296
so that we may always do good and be of benefit to others

3
00:00:23.633 --> 00:00:28.626
Anindosta, or Animasi Indonesia Semesta, is an organization that manages an animation studio

4
00:00:28.673 --> 00:00:33.589
working in futuristic 3D animated film and digital comics in Bogor

5
00:00:33.955 --> 00:00:40.384
Anindosta itself was founded in 2014 on the principle of building up animated filmmaking in Indonesia

6
00:00:40.385 --> 00:00:43.245
especially in the action and sci-fi genres

7
00:00:59.716 --> 00:01:05.220
Our project is titled Volter Stein - The Ultimate Law Enforcement, the story of a teenager named Arlo

8
00:01:05.595 --> 00:01:11.545
who must go through a long journey at his very young age to restore peace to his planet

9
00:01:12.354 --> 00:01:15.181
which has been taken over by an evil force called "Black Bug"

10
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:22.123
this project is planned to premiere in 2025, since we have not yet secured the production cost

11
00:01:22.483 --> 00:01:24.657
needed to carry out this project

12
00:01:25.156 --> 00:01:27.700
which will eventually be produced as 27 episodes

13
00:01:28.282 --> 00:01:32.000
with each episode running around 20-25 minutes

14
00:01:32.602 --> 00:01:34.754
over a production period of about 1-2 years

15
00:01:35.173 --> 00:01:38.882
the first year for research, and the second year for production

16
00:01:39.062 --> 00:01:44.588
we are currently producing a serialized digital comic that has already been published on the Webtoon platform

17
00:01:44.741 --> 00:01:49.233
to introduce each character's traits through spin-off stories of their daily lives

18
00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:55.823
one thing we firmly believe is that there is great future potential few people are aware of

19
00:01:56.178 --> 00:02:04.082
this great potential in animated film can be used to grow young people's creativity and, of course, reduce unemployment in Indonesia

20
00:02:04.696 --> 00:02:09.210
so that young people can be creative and pour their imaginative ideas out here at home

21
00:02:09.869 --> 00:02:17.268
That's all I can share on behalf of Anindosta Studios; my apologies for any shortcomings

22
00:02:18.001 --> 00:02:20.001
Wassalamualaikum Warahmatullahi Wabarakatuh
